{"3735900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OMNICORIUM", "steam_appid": 3735900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4810140], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FORGE YOUR PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OMNICORIUM</strong> is a persistent online heroic fantasy RPG focused on structured progression, specialization, and cooperative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your character and develop it through meaningful choices, optimized builds, and long-term growth. Every decision influences how you approach combat, crafting, and group play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE • GATHER • CRAFT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into dangerous areas to acquire resources and rare materials.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and process materials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft and improve equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop specialized loadouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for specific encounters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progression rewards planning, preparation, and efficiency.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE DUNGEONS AND ENCOUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face structured activities designed for solo players and coordinated groups.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter instanced challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build to defined roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate with allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refine strategy and execution</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is deliberate and build-driven.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD • SPECIALIZE • MASTER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new equipment paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your character over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade and interact with other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragr